## FLUTTER VERSION MANAGER

This project uses FVM (Flutter Version Manager).
Always use `fvm flutter` instead of `flutter` for all commands.
Always use `fvm dart` instead of `dart` for all Dart commands.
Flutter version: 3.35.7

Examples:
- `fvm flutter pub get`
- `fvm flutter pub run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`
- `fvm flutter test`
- `fvm flutter build apk`
- `fvm dart format .`


## DEPENDENCY VERSIONS

Always use the latest stable version of each package that:
- Is compatible with Flutter 3.35.7
- Does not introduce breaking changes
- Has null-safety support
- Is not marked as discontinued or deprecated on pub.dev

Before suggesting a package version, verify compatibility with
Flutter 3.35.7 and Dart SDK constraints.
Never pin to an outdated version unless a newer one causes
a known breaking change — in that case, explain why.


## ARCHITECTURE — CLEAN ARCHITECTURE (STRICT)

### Layer Rules

```
Presentation  →  Domain  ←  Data
```

- **Domain layer** has ZERO dependencies on Flutter, Firebase, or any external package.
  It only contains: Entities, Repository interfaces (abstract classes), Use cases, Failures.
- **Data layer** implements Domain repository interfaces. It knows about Firebase, Firestore,
  freezed models, and JSON. It maps data models to domain entities.
- **Presentation layer** calls Use Cases via Riverpod providers/notifiers. It NEVER calls
  repositories directly. It knows about Flutter widgets and Riverpod.
- Dependencies always point inward: Presentation → Domain ← Data.

### Folder Structure (feature-first + clean architecture)

```
lib/
├── core/
│   ├── constants/
│   │   ├── app_constants.dart         # String constants, collection names
│   │   ├── firestore_collections.dart # All Firestore collection/field name constants
│   │   └── route_constants.dart       # All GoRouter route name constants
│   ├── error/
│   │   ├── failures.dart              # All Failure classes (extends Failure)
│   │   └── exceptions.dart            # All Exception classes
│   ├── network/
│   │   └── network_info.dart          # connectivity_plus wrapper
│   ├── theme/
│   │   ├── app_theme.dart
│   │   ├── app_colors.dart
│   │   └── app_text_styles.dart
│   ├── utils/
│   │   ├── currency_formatter.dart    # GHS/USD formatting with intl
│   │   ├── date_formatter.dart
│   │   └── validators.dart
│   └── widgets/                       # Shared UI widgets (buttons, cards, loaders)
│
├── features/
│   └── [feature_name]/
│       ├── domain/
│       │   ├── entities/              # Pure Dart classes — NO freezed, NO json
│       │   ├── repositories/          # Abstract repository interfaces
│       │   └── usecases/              # One use case per file, returns Either<Failure, T>
│       ├── data/
│       │   ├── models/                # freezed + json_serializable models
│       │   ├── repositories/          # Implements domain repository interfaces
│       │   └── datasources/           # Firestore / Storage / API calls
│       └── presentation/
│           ├── screens/               # Screen widgets (one per route)
│           ├── widgets/               # Feature-specific reusable widgets
│           └── providers/             # Riverpod providers and notifiers
│
├── shared/
│   └── providers/
│       ├── firebase_providers.dart    # firebaseAuthProvider, firestoreProvider, storageProvider
│       └── exchange_rate_provider.dart
│
├── router.dart                        # GoRouter configuration
├── main.dart
└── firebase_options.dart
```

### Feature List

```
features/
  auth/           # OTP login, registration, ID upload
  orders/         # Order dashboard, timeline, multi-order list
  preferences/    # Car preference form (5 steps), edit preferences
  chat/           # Per-order messaging (all message types)
  vehicles/       # Vehicle option card detail + max bid
  bids/           # Bid status (won/lost)
  payments/       # Payment request view, checkout (Paystack), confirmation
  shipping/       # Shipping tracker
  clearance/      # Clearance choice + self-clearance checklist
  repairs/        # Repair choice + status screens
  documents/      # Per-order document vault
  notifications/  # Global notifications centre
  profile/        # Account settings, ID verification
```

