## NAVIGATION (GoRouter)

```dart
// router.dart
// Always use named routes
// Use redirect for auth guard

final router = GoRouter(
  routes: [
    GoRoute(name: 'splash', path: '/splash', builder: ...),
    GoRoute(name: 'home', path: '/home', builder: ...),
    GoRoute(
      name: 'order-detail',
      path: '/order/:orderId',
      builder: (context, state) => OrderDetailScreen(
        orderId: state.pathParameters['orderId']!,
      ),
    ),
    // etc.
  ],
  redirect: (context, state) {
    final isAuthenticated = // check auth state
    if (!isAuthenticated && !state.matchedLocation.startsWith('/login')) {
      return '/login';
    }
    return null;
  },
);
```

