## FIRESTORE SCHEMA REFERENCE

All Firestore field names use camelCase. The following collections and fields
must be referenced exactly as specified — any deviation will break data contracts
with the Agent App and Cloud Functions.

### users
id, fullName, phone, email, role (buyer/agent/admin), location, isFirstTimeBuyer,
isVerified, ghanaidUrl, ghanaidVerified, ghanaidVerifiedAt, preferredCurrency,
preferredLanguage, pushToken, lastActiveAt, createdAt, updatedAt

### agents
id, userId, employeeId, status (active/inactive/suspended), maxActiveOrders,
totalOrdersCompleted, successRate, rating, createdAt

### orders
id, orderRef, buyerId, agentId, status (open/agentAssigned/searching/bidPlaced/
bidWon/bidLost/paymentPending/paymentReceived/shipping/arrived/dutyPending/
dutyPaid/clearanceInProgress/clearanceComplete/repairPending/repairInProgress/
repairComplete/delivered/cancelled/dormant), currentStage, stageNumber,
firstPaymentMade, cancelledBy, cancellationReason, cancellationNote,
cancelledAt, deliveredAt, createdAt, updatedAt

### car_preferences
id, orderId, make, model, yearMin, yearMax, isSingleYear, condition
(run_and_drive/repairable/full_rebuild), conditionLabel, maxMileage,
repairOptedIn, clearanceOptedIn, editedBy, editedAt, editReason, createdAt

### preference_edit_history
id, orderId, editedByUserId, editedByRole, previousValuesJson, newValuesJson,
reason, buyerNotified, editedAt

### notifications
id, userId, orderId, type (payment_request/payment_confirmed/bid_won/bid_lost/
stage_update/message/agent_assigned/order_edited/order_cancelled/
inactivity_reminder/auction_deadline/shipping_update/arrival/id_reminder/system),
title, body, actionUrl, isRead, sentAt

### otp_sessions
id, userId, phone, codeHash, attempts, expiresAt, verified, createdAt

### user_sessions
id, userId, deviceToken, sessionToken, role, expiresAt, lastUsedAt, createdAt

### vehicle_options
id, orderId, agentId, lotNumber, source (copart/iaa), yearMakeModel, year,
make, model, trim, mileage, condition, conditionLabel, damageDescription,
photoUrl, photoUrlsJson, auctionDate, auctionLocation, vin, colour, engine,
transmission, auctionPriceUsd, buyersPremiumPct, buyersPremiumUsd,
towingStorageUsd, shippingUsd, marineInsuranceUsd, exchangeRate, dutyGhs,
clearanceGhs, repairEstimateGhs, serviceFeeGhs, totalLandedGhs, agentNote,
